WEBVTT

01:14.880 --> 01:19.009
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.010 --> 01:24.290
[Episode 05]

01:29.468 --> 01:30.467
Granny.

01:30.468 --> 01:31.618
Where are you going?

01:32.178 --> 01:34.027
I'm going to wash my hair in the kitchen.

01:34.028 --> 01:35.748
Why do you wash your hair in the kitchen?

01:36.618 --> 01:39.588
I forgot to add water
to the solar water heater yesterday.

01:39.588 --> 01:42.228
I'm afraid the water isn't enough.

01:42.748 --> 01:44.058
Go ahead.

01:44.058 --> 01:45.947
I can take a cold water bath.

01:45.948 --> 01:46.978
No.

01:46.978 --> 01:48.108
You may catch a cold.

01:48.108 --> 01:49.778
I'll just wash my hair.

01:49.778 --> 01:50.618
Okay, fine.

01:50.618 --> 01:51.698
I'll help you with it.

01:54.418 --> 01:55.867
Did you drink?

01:55.868 --> 01:56.867
Yes.

01:56.868 --> 01:58.508
I drank with Uncle Heshun.

01:59.698 --> 02:00.698
Let's go.

02:02.578 --> 02:03.578
Be careful.

02:10.978 --> 02:11.788
Lower your head.

02:11.788 --> 02:12.577
Okay.

02:12.578 --> 02:13.578
Be careful.

02:14.948 --> 02:15.948
Be careful.

02:18.068 --> 02:19.227
Good.

02:19.228 --> 02:19.738
It's okay.

02:19.738 --> 02:20.667
Pour the water here.

02:20.668 --> 02:21.668
Okay.

02:22.228 --> 02:23.228
Okay.

02:24.348 --> 02:25.138
Is the temperature okay?

02:25.138 --> 02:26.228
Yes.

02:31.578 --> 02:32.627
The temperature is okay?

02:32.628 --> 02:34.138
It's okay.

02:34.508 --> 02:36.257
It's good.

02:36.258 --> 02:37.418
Okay.

02:37.698 --> 02:38.788
Okay.

02:39.738 --> 02:40.668
It's wet now.

02:40.668 --> 02:41.948
Okay.

02:42.258 --> 02:43.258
Be careful.

02:45.228 --> 02:46.457
Good.

02:46.458 --> 02:46.788
Good.

02:46.788 --> 02:47.108
Okay.

02:47.108 --> 02:47.948
Pour it here.

02:47.948 --> 02:48.948
Okay.

02:54.138 --> 02:55.258
Granny.

02:55.258 --> 02:57.258
The water isn't hot at all.

02:57.258 --> 03:00.458
There isn't much sunshine,
so the water isn't hot.

03:00.458 --> 03:02.137
Dry your hair then go to sleep.

03:02.138 --> 03:03.228
Okay.

03:08.348 --> 03:09.458
Your hair isn't dry yet.

03:09.458 --> 03:10.418
You made the pillow wet.

03:10.418 --> 03:11.858
How can I sleep now?

03:11.858 --> 03:12.828
Sister.

03:12.828 --> 03:13.788
I'll show you something.

03:13.788 --> 03:14.788
What is it?

03:15.228 --> 03:16.578
Where did you get this worm?

03:16.578 --> 03:17.788
This is uang.

03:17.788 --> 03:20.018
There is One-horn King in Sun Wukong.

03:20.018 --> 03:21.258
It is turned from uang.

03:21.258 --> 03:22.458
That's Journey to the West.

03:22.458 --> 03:24.188
And there is no One-horn King.

03:24.188 --> 03:26.138
There are Golden-horn and Silver-horn Kings.

03:26.138 --> 03:27.738
Don't pretend you know it, throw it away.

03:27.738 --> 03:29.508
No, I want to keep it.

03:29.508 --> 03:30.818
Throw it or not?

03:31.828 --> 03:32.908
Give it to me.

03:33.858 --> 03:35.948
Granny, help!

03:35.948 --> 03:36.948
Give it to me.

03:37.458 --> 03:38.458
Give it to me.

03:39.418 --> 03:41.578
What's wrong with you?

03:41.578 --> 03:42.538
Granny.

03:42.538 --> 03:43.458
Look at her.

03:43.458 --> 03:45.108
She put the worm on the bed.

03:45.108 --> 03:46.348
That's not a worm.

03:46.348 --> 03:48.388
That's uang.

03:48.388 --> 03:51.068
If you want to keep the worm,
don't sleep with me.

03:51.068 --> 03:51.578
Give it to me.

03:51.578 --> 03:52.628
No.

03:52.628 --> 03:53.908
Give it to me.

03:53.908 --> 03:54.228
Granny.

03:54.228 --> 03:56.388
Enough, stop fighting.

03:56.388 --> 03:57.788
Granny.

03:57.788 --> 03:58.858
Give it to me.

03:58.858 --> 03:59.948
Granny.

03:59.948 --> 04:01.018
Okay, continue.

04:01.018 --> 04:01.977
Keep fighting.

04:01.978 --> 04:02.788
I'll leave.

04:02.788 --> 04:03.828
Just continue.

04:03.828 --> 04:05.108
Continue.

04:05.668 --> 04:07.508
Granny.

04:21.338 --> 04:23.387
Why did you open your eyes again?

04:23.388 --> 04:24.418
Sleep.

04:24.898 --> 04:25.898
Granny.

04:25.898 --> 04:27.698
I don't want to go home.

04:27.698 --> 04:29.178
Can I stay here?

04:31.338 --> 04:34.268
You need to go back
to learn to dance after summer vacation.

04:34.658 --> 04:36.108
I don't want to learn to dance.

04:37.548 --> 04:40.748
You want to learn to paint like your sister?

04:40.748 --> 04:42.858
I don't want to learn to paint.

04:44.658 --> 04:46.468
Then what do you want to learn?

04:46.898 --> 04:50.058
I want to raise chicks with you.

04:54.338 --> 04:56.508
What do you want to do when you grow up?

04:56.508 --> 04:58.788
Still raise chicks with me?

04:59.458 --> 05:03.348
I'll open a grocery store.

05:04.458 --> 05:05.588
Open a grocery store?

05:06.578 --> 05:09.747
I'll buy many ice creams and instant noodles.

05:09.748 --> 05:12.538
And I'll eat them every day.

05:15.338 --> 05:18.588
You eat the food in your store yourself?

05:18.868 --> 05:20.938
Then how can you make money?

05:21.218 --> 05:22.307
I can make money.

05:22.308 --> 05:23.868
I'll open a huge market.

05:23.868 --> 05:26.468
Then I'll buy you roast chicken
when I earned money.

05:28.548 --> 05:29.548
Okay.

05:30.988 --> 05:32.628
I'll wait for you.

05:32.628 --> 05:35.307
Open a huge market and earn money.

05:35.308 --> 05:37.108
Then buy me roast chicken.

05:39.868 --> 05:41.418
Go to sleep, sweetie.

05:59.308 --> 06:01.268
It's so comfortable.

06:21.988 --> 06:23.028
Damai.

06:24.388 --> 06:25.307
What's wrong?

06:25.308 --> 06:27.228
I want to use your phone.

06:36.578 --> 06:38.138
Here, no passcode.

06:38.138 --> 06:39.148
Thanks.

06:48.698 --> 06:50.508
Who is it?

06:50.508 --> 06:51.018
That's right.

06:51.018 --> 06:52.898
Hello, who is it?

06:52.898 --> 06:53.898
Hello, mom.

06:54.458 --> 06:55.498
Dou.

06:55.868 --> 06:56.948
What's wrong?

06:56.948 --> 06:57.748
It's so late.

06:57.748 --> 06:58.388
What happened?

06:58.388 --> 06:59.588
Anything?

07:50.068 --> 07:53.858
Your Hongdou called me
in the middle of the night.

07:54.308 --> 07:56.308
I thought something happened.

07:56.308 --> 08:00.018
But she said,
she just wanted me to see you,

08:00.018 --> 08:02.618
and buy you roast chicken.

08:03.698 --> 08:06.348
Did her granny appear in her dream?

08:06.828 --> 08:08.708
We sisters are so close to each other.

08:09.068 --> 08:10.698
Why would she appear in her dream?

08:10.698 --> 08:12.228
Grandma loves her granddaughter more.

08:12.898 --> 08:14.058
That's right.

08:18.698 --> 08:20.668
What is Hongmi doing recently?

08:21.068 --> 08:22.948
She is taking care of Lingdang now.

08:22.948 --> 08:25.268
Lingdang is learning chess now.

08:25.578 --> 08:27.828
I remember Lingdang is learning the piano.

08:27.828 --> 08:30.378
Learn the piano first then chess.

08:31.378 --> 08:34.468
Kexin is pregnant now.

08:35.268 --> 08:37.857
She has been doing antenatal training.

08:37.858 --> 08:40.898
She reads poems to her belly every day.

08:41.578 --> 08:45.618
Her mother-in-law also
bought some English books for her.

08:46.028 --> 08:48.308
No one can understand it.

08:49.028 --> 08:53.068
Time has passed so quickly,
generation after generation.

08:53.738 --> 08:54.428
That's right.

08:54.428 --> 08:56.948
You're going to be a granny soon.

08:57.828 --> 08:59.108
That's right.

09:46.618 --> 09:47.898
You woke up?

09:48.188 --> 09:49.858
You can make a cat teaser stick?

09:49.858 --> 09:51.028
I learned it on the internet.

09:51.028 --> 09:52.858
I just learned it,
it's a little ugly.

09:59.908 --> 10:00.978
Thanks.

10:06.308 --> 10:07.978
I'm coming.

10:07.978 --> 10:09.978
I'll be there soon.

10:14.218 --> 10:15.218
Hongdou.

10:19.458 --> 10:20.457
Damai.

10:20.458 --> 10:21.468
Damai.

10:21.908 --> 10:23.098
You've been here for a month.

10:23.098 --> 10:25.308
We only met each other twice, right?

10:26.548 --> 10:27.578
You're free, right?

10:27.578 --> 10:28.378
Go out and play with me.

10:28.378 --> 10:29.547
Let's make flower cakes.

10:29.548 --> 10:31.098
Cakes with roses in them?

10:31.098 --> 10:32.098
Yes.

10:32.098 --> 10:32.908
And milk fans.

10:32.908 --> 10:34.977
You haven't even heard of it.

10:34.978 --> 10:35.338
Let's go.

10:35.338 --> 10:35.828
Come on.

10:35.828 --> 10:36.498
Go ahead.

10:36.498 --> 10:37.708
I'll stay here.

10:38.338 --> 10:39.977
You little girl.

10:39.978 --> 10:41.978
After you came here,
you hid in the room every day,

10:41.978 --> 10:43.148
and didn't come out to meet people.

10:43.148 --> 10:44.098
Look at your face.

10:44.098 --> 10:45.977
You look so pale.

10:45.978 --> 10:47.428
You should walk outside.

10:47.428 --> 10:48.148
Let's go.

10:48.148 --> 10:48.738
I won't.

10:48.738 --> 10:50.188
- I can't do anything.
- Just go with us.

10:50.188 --> 10:52.547
It's simple, you can learn it.

10:52.548 --> 10:53.947
Jiahui, wait for me.

10:53.948 --> 10:54.378
Be good.

10:54.378 --> 10:55.618
I can't do anything.

10:55.618 --> 10:56.548
You will learn it.

10:56.548 --> 10:57.947
It's simple.

10:57.948 --> 10:58.948
Let's go.

10:59.338 --> 11:01.948
There are flower cakes and milk fans.

11:12.668 --> 11:14.258
It's finally quiet.

11:20.148 --> 11:21.228
Jiahui.

11:23.028 --> 11:24.428
I understand you.

11:27.148 --> 11:28.858
You like quiet places, right?

11:31.378 --> 11:32.858
We're the same.

11:36.668 --> 11:38.708
It's a cute cat,

11:39.308 --> 11:43.498
but it's uncomfortable
to tie this on your neck, right?

11:43.908 --> 11:45.188
I'll take it off for you.

11:46.428 --> 11:47.658
Lie down.

11:48.788 --> 11:50.738
I'll do Baduanjin exercise for you.

12:42.268 --> 12:44.468
Baoping, we're here.

12:45.068 --> 12:46.828
And I bring you helpers.

12:48.828 --> 12:50.737
The customers in the yard.

12:50.738 --> 12:53.377
This is Xiaochun's mom, Aunt Baoping.

12:53.378 --> 12:54.028
Hello.

12:54.028 --> 12:56.138
This is Hongdou and Damai.

12:57.068 --> 12:58.338
I know you two.

12:58.338 --> 12:59.738
Yao told me about you.

12:59.738 --> 13:00.788
I'll make some tea for you.

13:00.788 --> 13:01.268
No, thanks.

13:01.268 --> 13:02.188
We're not thirsty.

13:02.188 --> 13:03.578
What are you doing?

13:03.578 --> 13:04.788
I'm making milk fans.

13:04.788 --> 13:05.858
Milk fans?

13:05.858 --> 13:07.668
Is this the fried milk fan sold in the street?

13:07.668 --> 13:08.787
That's right.

13:08.788 --> 13:10.577
Here, have a taste.

13:10.578 --> 13:11.618
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

13:17.188 --> 13:18.658
It tastes like cheese.

13:18.948 --> 13:21.618
In the past,
we would sell it because we were poor.

13:21.858 --> 13:23.268
We seldom make it now.

13:23.268 --> 13:26.547
When we were selling it,
it was hung all over the yard.

13:26.548 --> 13:27.858
Well done, Aunt Baoping.

13:27.858 --> 13:28.828
It's nothing.

13:28.828 --> 13:30.267
I was just raising the family.

13:30.268 --> 13:31.268
Okay.

13:31.738 --> 13:32.948
Let's work now.

13:33.378 --> 13:34.658
Do you need help?

13:35.098 --> 13:36.028
Wash your hands first.

13:36.028 --> 13:37.258
And meet me in the kitchen.

13:49.978 --> 13:51.548
The fresh roses?

13:51.548 --> 13:52.618
Yes.

13:52.618 --> 13:53.618
Here.

13:53.858 --> 13:55.258
Is it fragrant?

13:57.858 --> 14:01.067
There are two ways
to make the filling in the flower cakes.

14:01.068 --> 14:04.668
One way is to make it
into rose jam a week in advance,

14:04.668 --> 14:05.618
and wrap it in the cakes.

14:05.618 --> 14:07.828
The other way is to make fresh flower cakes.

14:08.068 --> 14:11.667
There are lard oil, paste powder and sugar in it.

14:11.668 --> 14:12.618
Then mix them together.

14:12.618 --> 14:15.588
Now I'm going to mix them together.

14:16.338 --> 14:17.858
You're making flower cakes and milk fans,

14:17.858 --> 14:19.348
is there a festival to celebrate?

14:20.338 --> 14:21.708
No.

14:22.548 --> 14:24.617
Baoping's son, Xiaxia,

14:24.618 --> 14:27.147
is going to Shanghai to find his friend.

14:27.148 --> 14:29.978
Baoping wants to make some specialties,

14:29.978 --> 14:32.828
and let his friend in Shanghai taste it.

14:33.308 --> 14:37.098
In my home,
Yang and Xi haven't been back for a long time,

14:37.098 --> 14:40.228
so I'll make more and send them some.

14:40.548 --> 14:44.378
You can buy these outside,
but if you make it yourself,

14:44.378 --> 14:47.188
there will be a taste of hometown, right?

14:48.948 --> 14:50.497
I'll mix it first.

14:50.498 --> 14:52.138
Then we can wrap it.

14:56.188 --> 14:58.548
Should I leave early if I want
to take a boat at Huangpu River?

15:00.668 --> 15:01.858
Is there delicious food on it?

15:01.858 --> 15:02.858
Is it expensive?

15:03.618 --> 15:04.858
I don't know.

15:06.098 --> 15:07.228
You haven't been there?

15:07.458 --> 15:10.018
I've been there,
but it was when I was little. I forgot.

15:10.498 --> 15:11.828
Are you a local here?

15:12.738 --> 15:14.108
Do you want to see my ID card?

15:14.618 --> 15:16.217
No, thanks.

15:16.218 --> 15:17.548
You're welcome.

15:18.828 --> 15:20.498
I said you're welcome.

15:24.698 --> 15:26.308
Have you eaten this waffle?

15:27.458 --> 15:29.018
No, I haven't.

15:30.498 --> 15:31.668
Why do you know nothing?

15:31.668 --> 15:35.018
My friend in Shanghai knows
all delicious and interesting things.

15:35.618 --> 15:38.108
Then ask him about it, why me?

15:38.698 --> 15:39.828
He is working now.

15:39.828 --> 15:41.058
I don't want to disturb him.

15:42.858 --> 15:44.468
Then why do you disturb me?

15:47.388 --> 15:49.268
[Chen Kaiwen]

15:57.268 --> 16:00.008
[The fund is only 1000 yuan, so the profit is 300 yuan.]

16:08.628 --> 16:09.628
[That's enough, thanks, bro.]

16:09.628 --> 16:12.108
[You can open an account yourself.
I'll take you to make money.]

16:15.068 --> 16:16.217
Nana.

16:16.218 --> 16:17.348
Do you buy stock?

16:17.668 --> 16:20.308
No, I buy funds.

16:20.738 --> 16:21.778
Does it make money?

16:22.738 --> 16:23.978
It's hard to say.

16:23.978 --> 16:26.708
The market is good recently,
so I earned some money.

16:28.028 --> 16:29.188
You want to buy stock?

16:29.738 --> 16:31.188
Do you think I can?

16:32.578 --> 16:33.578
No.

16:33.618 --> 16:34.947
It's too risky.

16:34.948 --> 16:36.858
You know nothing about it.

16:36.858 --> 16:39.948
When you enter this industry,
you'll be cheated by them.

16:46.828 --> 16:48.067
Xie Xiaoxia.

16:48.068 --> 16:48.308
Sister.

16:48.308 --> 16:49.788
You're being lazy here, right?

16:49.788 --> 16:50.578
What time is it now?

16:50.578 --> 16:51.218
You're leaving.

16:51.218 --> 16:52.898
Why don't you help mom do more work?

16:54.378 --> 16:55.218
What?

16:55.218 --> 16:58.018
Let me tell you,
I'll kick you if it happens again.

16:59.268 --> 17:01.228
His heart is not here now.

17:01.228 --> 17:02.988
It's useless to blame him.

17:05.788 --> 17:08.858
When can my brother grow up?

17:09.898 --> 17:12.228
A leading role in a TV series said,

17:12.228 --> 17:14.658
people will grow up in a moment.

17:14.938 --> 17:16.178
A moment?

17:16.418 --> 17:17.458
Which moment?

17:18.028 --> 17:21.698
It's a moment
that only you know and others don't,

17:22.268 --> 17:23.348
This is what he said.

17:24.508 --> 17:29.547
Well, I think my brother
will grow up at the moment,

17:29.548 --> 17:35.227
when he died in his bed
and was buried in a coffin.

17:35.228 --> 17:36.987
What did you say?

17:36.988 --> 17:38.178
So mean.

17:38.178 --> 17:39.548
You're really his sister.

17:44.828 --> 17:45.898
Peng.

17:46.938 --> 17:48.097
Did you see Yuan?

17:48.098 --> 17:49.348
He is in the stable.

17:50.748 --> 17:51.468
Take care of him.

17:51.468 --> 17:52.748
Don't worry.

18:04.068 --> 18:05.068
Uncle Zeqing.

18:05.338 --> 18:06.588
Did you see Yuan?

18:06.938 --> 18:08.827
He said he has a stomachache,
so I let him go home.

18:08.828 --> 18:10.177
Anything wrong?

18:10.178 --> 18:11.828
Nothing, just continue.

18:23.028 --> 18:24.828
Hello, aunt.

18:25.338 --> 18:26.348
It's me.

18:26.938 --> 18:28.707
I'm at the stud farm.

18:28.708 --> 18:29.938
Yuan is not here.

18:29.938 --> 18:31.417
I guess he went back home.

18:31.418 --> 18:33.307
What's wrong with him?

18:33.308 --> 18:36.308
Your dad said he should
exercise in the countryside.

18:36.308 --> 18:39.417
After he experienced the bitterness,
he'll go back to study.

18:39.418 --> 18:41.588
Why is he enjoying life now?

18:42.468 --> 18:44.507
You're letting him find his nature.

18:44.508 --> 18:45.748
I can do nothing about it.

18:45.988 --> 18:49.178
As his brother,
hit him if he doesn't behave well.

18:50.418 --> 18:51.897
Hit him?

18:51.898 --> 18:54.348
If I hurt him,
you'll feel distressed.

18:55.228 --> 18:56.787
Then don't stop your granny.

18:56.788 --> 18:58.178
Let your granny hit him.

18:58.988 --> 19:01.788
This is not that serious.

19:02.228 --> 19:03.827
If he really doesn't want to go back,

19:03.828 --> 19:06.698
I'll find a school for him here in Dali.

19:07.028 --> 19:08.418
Don't worry.

19:08.898 --> 19:10.268
Okay, bye-bye.

19:28.898 --> 19:29.898
Go!

19:35.681 --> 19:40.408
♫ There are stars in my journey ♫

19:40.762 --> 19:43.708
♫ There are rainbows ♫

19:45.241 --> 19:48.428
♫ We miss the hug from each other ♫

19:48.718 --> 19:53.308
♫ There is a breeze in the world ♫

19:53.678 --> 19:56.708
♫ I flipped when I met someone ♫

19:58.428 --> 20:01.588
♫ Whose dream I'll appear in ♫

20:01.982 --> 20:03.828
♫ In the street ♫

20:03.828 --> 20:04.938
Well done, Hongdou.

20:05.938 --> 20:07.228
You're good at it.

20:07.228 --> 20:08.228
Is it too small?

20:08.858 --> 20:09.988
It's okay.

20:11.475 --> 20:13.468
♫ We said goodbye ♫

20:13.468 --> 20:15.068
There is temperature.

20:16.378 --> 20:17.458
I'll do it.

20:17.898 --> 20:19.618
Put the acid pulp in it.

20:20.748 --> 20:24.668
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

20:25.146 --> 20:28.764
♫ I'll still love it as when I was young ♫

20:28.765 --> 20:32.788
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

20:33.828 --> 20:37.628
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

20:38.078 --> 20:42.828
♫ Maybe things would happen as I wish ♫

20:43.411 --> 20:47.388
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

20:48.432 --> 20:52.308
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

20:53.002 --> 20:56.268
♫ I'll still love it as when I was young ♫

20:56.562 --> 21:00.417
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

21:00.418 --> 21:01.138
I'll put sugar in it.

21:01.138 --> 21:02.548
Use two hands to rub.

21:02.548 --> 21:05.428
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

21:05.928 --> 21:11.068
♫ Maybe things would happen as I wish ♫

21:22.988 --> 21:24.828
Coming.

21:25.708 --> 21:26.468
Here.

21:26.468 --> 21:27.827
It's hot.

21:27.828 --> 21:29.138
Don't touch this plate.

21:29.548 --> 21:30.548
Have a try.

21:37.089 --> 21:38.239
Baoping.

21:42.178 --> 21:43.858
Your oven is not good.

21:44.268 --> 21:45.468
It must be cheap.

21:45.468 --> 21:46.468
The power is too low.

21:46.468 --> 21:47.468
See?

21:47.938 --> 21:50.108
It's not crispy, right?

21:50.578 --> 21:52.377
Come to my home to make it.

21:52.378 --> 21:55.097
We can use the big oven Xi bought for me.

21:55.098 --> 21:58.698
The power is high and there are many functions.

21:59.028 --> 22:00.097
Enough.

22:00.098 --> 22:02.378
You like everything Xi bought for you.

22:02.898 --> 22:04.268
That's right.

22:04.618 --> 22:05.618
Is it delicious?

22:05.618 --> 22:06.618
Yes.

22:06.898 --> 22:07.937
Delicious.

22:07.938 --> 22:09.988
It'll be more delicious with a better oven.

22:10.268 --> 22:11.467
Hongdou.

22:11.468 --> 22:12.788
Give this to Yao.

22:12.788 --> 22:13.828
Granny likes to eat it.

22:13.828 --> 22:15.308
Okay, no problem.

22:15.618 --> 22:16.658
Aunt Baoping.

22:16.658 --> 22:19.748
Can you give me the milk fans I made?

22:19.748 --> 22:20.897
No problem.

22:20.898 --> 22:23.098
When it became dry,
I'll wrap it,

22:23.098 --> 22:24.508
then you can let your parents have a taste.

22:24.508 --> 22:25.578
Thanks, Aunt Baoping.

22:25.578 --> 22:26.178
Aunt Baoping.

22:26.178 --> 22:29.028
We ate and took back a lot,
but we didn't help much.

22:29.468 --> 22:31.348
I'm happy to have you here.

22:32.028 --> 22:32.898
We shall leave now.

22:32.898 --> 22:33.508
Okay.

22:33.508 --> 22:34.068
Bye-bye.

22:34.068 --> 22:34.828
Be careful.

22:34.828 --> 22:35.378
Okay.

22:35.378 --> 22:36.748
Bye-bye, Aunt Baoping.

23:10.708 --> 23:14.987
Take a shower.

23:14.988 --> 23:16.268
My dear brother.

23:16.268 --> 23:17.588
What do we eat tonight?

23:18.308 --> 23:20.108
What do we eat?

23:20.828 --> 23:21.988
Braised chicken.

23:22.308 --> 23:23.418
Braised chicken!

23:23.418 --> 23:24.468
Where is granny?

23:24.468 --> 23:25.698
She went out to visit others.

23:29.618 --> 23:31.178
Delicious!

23:31.178 --> 23:32.858
Brother, where is rice?

23:33.708 --> 23:35.458
I'm heating the leftover rice.

23:36.028 --> 23:37.108
Come here.

23:37.618 --> 23:38.898
I have something to tell you.

23:41.308 --> 23:42.698
Here it comes again.

24:02.068 --> 24:03.748
Why are you looking at me? Just say it.

24:05.468 --> 24:07.858
I ask my friend
in the Old Town to ask about school...

24:07.858 --> 24:08.898
I won't go!

24:09.788 --> 24:11.068
I won't go there!

24:14.028 --> 24:15.307
I won't go.

24:15.308 --> 24:16.507
Don't ask about it.

24:16.508 --> 24:17.548
I'm so bad at studying.

24:17.548 --> 24:18.707
It's useless to change schools.

24:18.708 --> 24:20.707
I'll be laughed at.

24:20.708 --> 24:22.137
Then go back to Kunming.

24:22.138 --> 24:23.577
At least, finish high school first.

24:23.578 --> 24:24.308
I won't.

24:24.308 --> 24:25.787
I won't go there.

24:25.788 --> 24:27.377
It's no big deal.

24:27.378 --> 24:29.467
It's shameful that you act like this, okay?

24:29.468 --> 24:31.507
They'll laugh at me secretly.

24:31.508 --> 24:34.177
I've become the joke of the whole school.

24:34.178 --> 24:35.578
It's stressful to learn in high school.

24:35.578 --> 24:36.828
They have no time to laugh at you.

24:36.828 --> 24:38.508
Who do you think you are?

24:38.898 --> 24:40.787
It sounds simple.

24:40.788 --> 24:45.028
In my whole life,
my reputation was totally ruined.

24:45.378 --> 24:48.657
I'd rather die,
than go back to Kunming.

24:48.658 --> 24:50.308
You'd rather die?

24:50.548 --> 24:53.178
You just had a stomachache,
and pooped in your pants.

24:53.468 --> 24:54.857
Xie Zhiyao!

24:54.858 --> 24:57.857
Don't mention it,
or I'll die in front of you.

24:57.858 --> 24:59.828
Then die after you finished high school.

25:14.418 --> 25:16.308
Aunt Baoping asked me
to give you the flower cakes.

25:16.308 --> 25:17.378
I shall leave now.

25:17.898 --> 25:18.858
Wait.

25:18.858 --> 25:20.177
You can't go.

25:20.178 --> 25:21.617
Xie Zhiyuan, what are you doing?

25:21.618 --> 25:22.617
Let her go.

25:22.618 --> 25:24.067
No, I won't.

25:24.068 --> 25:25.227
I won't go.

25:25.228 --> 25:25.788
Are you okay?

25:25.788 --> 25:26.858
Are you hurt?

25:48.138 --> 25:49.418
Why are you laughing?

25:51.338 --> 25:53.657
After you pooped in pants,
no one can laugh now?

25:53.658 --> 25:55.308
Don't mention it.

25:57.828 --> 25:59.548
Be nice to him.

25:59.548 --> 26:00.658
Don't hit him.

26:01.548 --> 26:03.067
She can't leave.

26:03.068 --> 26:04.988
What if she tells others and ruins my reputation?

26:04.988 --> 26:06.378
Who do you think you are?

26:06.378 --> 26:07.228
Ruin your reputation?

26:07.228 --> 26:08.307
Do you have that?

26:08.308 --> 26:09.138
Why...

26:09.138 --> 26:10.337
Don't worry.

26:10.338 --> 26:11.988
I won't tell anyone about it.

26:13.828 --> 26:15.068
I don't believe you.

26:15.858 --> 26:16.787
Fine.

26:16.788 --> 26:17.788
Tell me what you want.

26:17.788 --> 26:18.858
I'll listen to you.

26:22.228 --> 26:23.308
You...

26:32.228 --> 26:33.378
What do you want?

26:39.548 --> 26:40.747
Have you had supper?

26:40.748 --> 26:41.858
Not yet.

26:42.658 --> 26:44.267
Let's eat together.

26:44.268 --> 26:46.787
I brought this braised chicken
from Aunt Hua's home.

26:46.788 --> 26:48.658
No wonder it smells delicious.

26:48.658 --> 26:49.938
I'll have a try.

26:49.938 --> 26:50.708
Take a seat.

26:50.708 --> 26:51.898
- I'll bring rice.
- Okay.

26:56.508 --> 26:58.108
I'll bring the rice.

27:11.828 --> 27:13.028
I won't go.

27:13.548 --> 27:14.618
I'll have supper here.

27:18.338 --> 27:20.028
Granny isn't home today?

27:28.578 --> 27:29.578
Let's have supper.

27:35.068 --> 27:36.138
It's still warm.

27:38.858 --> 27:40.028
We won't wait for granny?

27:40.548 --> 27:41.788
She went to take a walk outside.

27:41.788 --> 27:43.218
I'll pick her up later.

27:43.938 --> 27:44.938
Okay.

27:47.748 --> 27:50.348
Aunt Gui asked you to help her?

27:50.618 --> 27:52.268
She is afraid Damai and I are bored,

27:52.268 --> 27:53.588
so she invited us to play.

27:54.268 --> 27:55.418
Is it interesting?

27:55.418 --> 27:56.588
Yes.

27:58.658 --> 28:02.467
Aunt Baoping can take you
to the warehouse later.

28:02.468 --> 28:04.507
Warehouse? What is it?

28:04.508 --> 28:06.938
That's where she works, an e-commerce warehouse.

28:07.508 --> 28:08.988
Have you packed before?

28:09.508 --> 28:10.658
No.

28:11.028 --> 28:12.828
Don't ask me to work.

28:13.508 --> 28:16.378
Okay. I'll find you when I have delicious food.

28:16.858 --> 28:18.028
Is it delicious?

28:20.028 --> 28:22.097
The chicken is so tender.

28:22.098 --> 28:23.178
It's delicious.

28:23.618 --> 28:24.937
At this time,

28:24.938 --> 28:28.068
if we drink a cup
of the cherry wine my granny made,

28:28.068 --> 28:29.897
that would be perfect.

28:29.898 --> 28:31.028
Cherry wine?

28:32.898 --> 28:33.898
Go.

28:33.938 --> 28:35.788
Fetch the wine on the kitchen shelf.

28:37.708 --> 28:38.657
Just go.

28:38.658 --> 28:39.698
Why are you watching?

29:37.068 --> 29:38.308
Half a cup is enough.

29:38.828 --> 29:41.378
Although this wine is sweet,
it contains a lot of alcohol.

29:41.378 --> 29:42.458
Drink it slowly.

29:49.988 --> 29:51.378
A strong taste of cherry.

29:51.618 --> 29:53.987
This kind of wild cherry is sour when you eat it.

29:53.988 --> 29:55.378
It's suitable to make wine.

30:24.938 --> 30:25.988
Keep it a secret.

30:25.988 --> 30:27.027
You promised me.

30:27.028 --> 30:27.828
Don't worry.

30:27.828 --> 30:29.138
I'll keep it a secret.

30:32.468 --> 30:33.308
Sorry.

30:33.308 --> 30:34.378
Naughty boy.

30:34.378 --> 30:35.618
Please forgive him.

30:35.618 --> 30:36.547
It's okay.

30:36.548 --> 30:38.377
I feel sorry for him.

30:38.378 --> 30:39.548
Feel sorry for him?

30:39.548 --> 30:41.138
You can feel sorry for me.

30:41.138 --> 30:43.137
He is torturing me.

30:43.138 --> 30:44.098
I'm not kidding.

30:44.098 --> 30:48.108
Teenagers have the highest self-esteem
at their sixteen or seventeen.

30:48.378 --> 30:50.508
And he was so embarrassed in class.

30:50.788 --> 30:53.268
What if there is a girl he likes?

30:54.098 --> 30:56.748
I understand why he doesn't go to school.

30:57.788 --> 30:59.787
He quit school
after meeting a little difficulty.

30:59.788 --> 31:01.467
His life is long.

31:01.468 --> 31:03.547
What if he met a more embarrassing thing?

31:03.548 --> 31:05.788
How can he understand what you said now?

31:10.028 --> 31:11.548
Do you have cousins?

31:12.378 --> 31:12.748
Yes.

31:12.748 --> 31:14.137
I have a sister.

31:14.138 --> 31:15.468
She is five years older than me.

31:15.468 --> 31:17.068
Her child is in kindergarten.

31:18.378 --> 31:19.987
Five years older?

31:19.988 --> 31:21.267
That's much better.

31:21.268 --> 31:22.698
Why do you say that?

31:23.308 --> 31:24.658
You'll also argue?

31:24.938 --> 31:27.337
What does it have to do with age?

31:27.338 --> 31:28.508
Then what is it related to?

31:28.508 --> 31:29.748
Character.

31:30.788 --> 31:32.028
You'll argue for your whole life?

31:38.618 --> 31:39.858
Be careful.

31:45.708 --> 31:50.748
♫ I see the scenery under the sunset ♫

31:53.108 --> 31:59.487
♫ The rain under the eave dropped into my eyes ♫

31:59.488 --> 32:04.868
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

32:07.949 --> 32:12.668
♫ The dawn is approaching quietly ♫

32:15.276 --> 32:20.108
♫ I'm waiting for the sea birds to call my name ♫

32:26.748 --> 32:27.898
You're back?

32:29.098 --> 32:30.938
What did Mi buy again?

32:31.468 --> 32:32.788
Dou sent it.

32:37.468 --> 32:38.578
What is it?

32:38.578 --> 32:40.658
I guess it's Yunnan's specialty.

32:40.938 --> 32:42.028
Let me have a look.

32:43.708 --> 32:46.137
We've bought it before.

32:46.138 --> 32:47.418
We don't like to eat it.

32:47.418 --> 32:50.577
Tell the kids,
don't waste money on it anymore.

32:50.578 --> 32:51.468
You don't like it?

32:51.468 --> 32:53.468
You ate much after they bought it.

32:53.468 --> 32:57.068
You don't eat it, if I don't eat it,
it will be wasted.

32:57.068 --> 32:57.788
After you ate it,

32:57.788 --> 32:59.708
you lied to them and told them it's delicious.

32:59.708 --> 33:01.067
Now they sent you again.

33:01.068 --> 33:03.068
They've bought it,
and spent money on it.

33:03.068 --> 33:05.858
If you said it's not delicious,
they'll feel upset.

33:05.858 --> 33:06.938
Do you know what this is?

33:06.938 --> 33:08.508
This is a lack of EQ.

33:08.508 --> 33:10.027
Your EQ is high.

33:10.028 --> 33:11.708
I'll say the mean words.

33:11.708 --> 33:13.618
And you're the good man.

33:15.858 --> 33:16.707
Mom.

33:16.708 --> 33:19.138
I went to a local aunt's home,

33:19.138 --> 33:21.658
and made the flower cakes and rose jam myself.

33:21.658 --> 33:22.828
Have a try.

33:23.098 --> 33:24.747
Dou made it herself.

33:24.748 --> 33:26.268
Well done.

33:26.508 --> 33:28.067
Wait.

33:28.068 --> 33:30.508
I'll call and ask her if we need to heat it.

33:37.268 --> 33:38.467
Hello.

33:38.468 --> 33:40.378
The phone you dialed is powered off.

33:40.378 --> 33:42.178
Her phone isn't fixed yet.

33:42.418 --> 33:44.178
It's so annoying.

33:50.098 --> 33:50.788
Hello.

33:50.788 --> 33:51.618
Mi.

33:51.618 --> 33:52.617
Mom.

33:52.618 --> 33:54.308
Let me ask you,

33:54.308 --> 33:58.458
do we need to heat
the flower cake before eating it?

33:59.138 --> 34:00.787
Xu Hongdou sent it to you?

34:00.788 --> 34:02.707
Yes, we just received it.

34:02.708 --> 34:05.267
Mom, let me remind you.

34:05.268 --> 34:06.588
It contains a lot of sugar.

34:06.828 --> 34:08.538
You and father went
for a health checkup recently.

34:08.538 --> 34:10.238
The doctor said your blood sugar is high.

34:10.498 --> 34:11.338
Don't eat too much.

34:11.338 --> 34:13.017
Give some to the neighbors.

34:13.018 --> 34:13.858
We know.

34:13.858 --> 34:16.107
Tell me if I need to heat it.

34:16.108 --> 34:17.058
Whatever.

34:17.058 --> 34:18.857
She also sent it to me.

34:18.858 --> 34:19.748
What is wrong with her?

34:19.748 --> 34:22.227
Why did she buy so many flower cakes?

34:22.228 --> 34:24.178
It's not healthy to eat too much sugar.

34:24.628 --> 34:27.267
She didn't buy it,
she made it herself.

34:27.268 --> 34:29.058
Don't you have a small card?

34:29.058 --> 34:31.187
There is a small card in the box.

34:31.188 --> 34:33.428
It seems she is really boring.

34:34.788 --> 34:36.868
Mom, I still need to work.

34:37.148 --> 34:38.588
I'll hang up, bye-bye.

34:42.498 --> 34:43.698
It's delicious.

34:46.978 --> 34:48.258
Delicious.

34:48.628 --> 34:50.338
I'll make some tea.

34:50.828 --> 34:52.428
Don't eat too much.

34:52.708 --> 34:54.388
There are roses in it.

34:57.628 --> 34:58.628
Manager Xu.

34:58.788 --> 34:59.377
Manager Xu.

34:59.378 --> 35:00.378
Manager Xu.

35:02.538 --> 35:03.497
Manager Xu.

35:03.498 --> 35:04.747
Only two cakes are left?

35:04.748 --> 35:06.228
When they went to have a meeting upstairs,

35:06.228 --> 35:07.388
they took a box with them.

35:10.108 --> 35:13.388
[Xu Hongmi, I made these myself. Taste it.]

35:13.938 --> 35:15.227
Is it delicious?

35:15.228 --> 35:15.938
Of course.

35:15.938 --> 35:17.388
It's tasty.

35:19.708 --> 35:21.108
My sister made it herself.

35:28.588 --> 35:32.107
Nanxing's mom and dad,
I made the flower cakes myself.

35:32.108 --> 35:34.057
Put it in the fridge if you can't eat them all.

35:34.058 --> 35:35.707
Please take care.

35:35.708 --> 35:37.508
I'll visit you later.

35:40.228 --> 35:43.417
She can make flower cakes?

35:43.418 --> 35:44.508
Have a taste.

35:45.268 --> 35:46.548
It looks delicious.

35:51.748 --> 35:52.787
Delicious.

35:52.788 --> 35:53.788
It's delicious.

36:59.498 --> 37:01.298
You scared me.

37:01.978 --> 37:04.028
What are you doing here?

37:04.748 --> 37:06.698
To find my jeans.

37:08.788 --> 37:10.548
The one that I often wear.

37:11.148 --> 37:12.828
It may be in your sister's room.

37:12.828 --> 37:14.828
Jeans are the same.

37:14.828 --> 37:16.028
I can't distinguish it.

37:20.898 --> 37:23.667
I've dyed some,
and sent them to be framed.

37:23.668 --> 37:26.147
You can put it on sale next week.

37:26.148 --> 37:27.148
Great.

37:28.498 --> 37:29.498
Yao.

37:29.538 --> 37:31.058
Yao, Yao.

37:31.058 --> 37:32.497
Please help me.

37:32.498 --> 37:35.497
Well,
that foreigner can't understand me.

37:35.498 --> 37:37.898
You can say English.

37:37.898 --> 37:38.668
Tell him about it.

37:38.668 --> 37:39.668
Tell him about it for me, here.

37:39.668 --> 37:40.668
Okay.

37:40.668 --> 37:42.068
What do you want to say?

37:42.498 --> 37:43.148
See?

37:43.148 --> 37:44.338
He needs to tie it tight.

37:44.338 --> 37:46.017
His is too loose.

37:46.018 --> 37:47.948
It will be ugly after dyeing.

37:49.308 --> 37:51.788
Granny said,
the cloth needs to be tight.

37:51.788 --> 37:54.338
If not, the dyeing effect won't be good.

37:55.108 --> 37:58.057
I know mandarin,
but I don't know what she said.

37:58.058 --> 38:00.058
Sorry, she speaks a dialect.

38:00.058 --> 38:01.338
Okay.

38:01.978 --> 38:03.338
What did you tell him?

38:03.748 --> 38:05.747
He said he can't understand you.

38:05.748 --> 38:08.108
You don't need
to speak to him, just use gestures.

38:08.498 --> 38:09.708
Don't go.

38:09.708 --> 38:11.107
I'll be afraid if you leave.

38:11.108 --> 38:12.468
What are you afraid of?

38:12.828 --> 38:14.628
I'm afraid he'll speak to me.

38:14.628 --> 38:16.417
He won't speak to you anymore.

38:16.418 --> 38:17.018
Don't go.

38:17.018 --> 38:18.058
Just sit here.

38:18.058 --> 38:19.668
Granny, I have something to deal with.

38:19.668 --> 38:21.228
I need to go to the embroidery workshop.

38:21.228 --> 38:22.148
Don't go.

38:22.148 --> 38:23.268
Sit here.

38:23.268 --> 38:25.898
Granny Zhao, you're commanding the boss?

38:25.898 --> 38:26.938
He is the boss?

38:26.938 --> 38:28.668
Yes.

38:28.668 --> 38:29.378
That's right.

38:29.378 --> 38:30.588
He also has a stud farm.

38:30.588 --> 38:32.107
You can ride a horse there.

38:32.108 --> 38:33.298
Where is it?

38:34.108 --> 38:35.628
There are brochures on the table.

38:35.628 --> 38:36.378
There is a map on it.

38:36.378 --> 38:38.377
You can see where you want to go.

38:38.378 --> 38:40.628
Sisters and aunts,
I should leave now.

38:40.628 --> 38:43.108
Xiaolan and Gezi went to Xinjiang.

38:43.108 --> 38:44.668
Call me if you need anything.

38:44.668 --> 38:46.307
Don't go.

38:46.308 --> 38:48.018
Granny, he is busy.

38:48.018 --> 38:49.977
I want to go to the stud farm.

38:49.978 --> 38:51.108
Okay.

38:51.748 --> 38:53.388
43.5 kg.

38:57.588 --> 38:58.588
What are you doing?

38:58.588 --> 38:59.828
Put it down gently.

38:59.828 --> 39:01.417
We unload goods like this.

39:01.418 --> 39:02.107
It's okay.

39:02.108 --> 39:03.377
It's okay?

39:03.378 --> 39:05.938
If it's broken,
customers would ask us to compensate.

39:05.938 --> 39:07.338
Will you compensate it for us?

39:07.978 --> 39:11.268
Ask the packer to check it carefully.

39:11.268 --> 39:14.977
If it's broken,
take it out and ask them to take it back.

39:14.978 --> 39:16.747
Be careful.

39:16.748 --> 39:17.588
Okay.

39:17.588 --> 39:18.677
Chuchu.

39:18.678 --> 39:19.418
Watch them carefully.

39:19.418 --> 39:20.468
Okay, manager.

39:26.018 --> 39:27.018
Aunt.

39:27.228 --> 39:29.458
Oranges that are as ugly as this one,

39:29.458 --> 39:30.977
you should pick it out.

39:30.978 --> 39:32.108
Don't put it in.

39:32.108 --> 39:33.108
Okay.

39:41.378 --> 39:44.627
What did you say to Dabin outside?

39:44.628 --> 39:46.258
What's wrong?

39:47.148 --> 39:49.857
According to seniority,
you should call him uncle.

39:49.858 --> 39:51.497
Be nice.

39:51.498 --> 39:53.747
What seniority?

39:53.748 --> 39:56.378
He is just a young man in his twenties.

39:56.378 --> 39:58.338
He is work so carelessly,
why can't I blame him?

39:58.338 --> 39:59.308
I'm nice enough.

39:59.308 --> 40:00.538
We live in the same village.

40:00.538 --> 40:02.898
Stop saying that.

40:02.898 --> 40:04.668
We live in the same village, so what?

40:04.668 --> 40:06.428
This is our job.

40:07.108 --> 40:07.828
Xiaochun...

40:07.828 --> 40:08.828
Mom.

40:10.538 --> 40:12.508
You should call me manager here.

40:12.788 --> 40:13.788
Little Fatty.

40:13.788 --> 40:15.258
Aunt E.

40:15.788 --> 40:17.308
Call her manager.

40:17.308 --> 40:18.188
That's right.

40:18.188 --> 40:19.267
Dear manager.

40:19.268 --> 40:20.017
Okay.

40:20.018 --> 40:21.338
Manager.

40:21.708 --> 40:23.828
Have you heard of the thing of Yuan?

40:23.828 --> 40:26.178
Yuan? What's wrong with him?

40:27.268 --> 40:28.268
What's wrong?

40:33.538 --> 40:34.698
Xu Hongdou!

40:35.338 --> 40:36.308
Xu Hongdou!

40:36.308 --> 40:37.897
Xu Hongdou, come out.

40:37.898 --> 40:39.337
Xu Hongdou!

40:39.338 --> 40:40.228
Xu Hongdou!

40:40.228 --> 40:41.828
Hongdou went out.

40:41.828 --> 40:43.388
Why are you looking for her?

40:48.268 --> 40:50.028
Naughty boy.

40:51.748 --> 40:53.138
What's the movement next?

41:12.228 --> 41:14.148
[Mom: Haven't you fixed the phone yet?]

41:14.148 --> 41:16.428
[We've received the flower cakes.]

41:20.148 --> 41:22.428
[Xing]

41:27.148 --> 41:28.228
Is it okay?

41:28.228 --> 41:29.228
No problem.

41:29.538 --> 41:30.228
What should I scan?

41:30.228 --> 41:30.978
1380 yuan.

41:30.978 --> 41:31.978
Scan here.

41:36.308 --> 41:37.748
Xu Hongdou!

41:37.748 --> 41:39.308
You promised me to keep it a secret.

41:39.308 --> 41:40.778
You liar.

41:50.628 --> 41:52.108
[The Ordinary World]

42:06.338 --> 42:07.338
Hello.

42:08.978 --> 42:10.108
Xu Hongdou?

42:11.858 --> 42:13.938
Yuan called you?

42:13.938 --> 42:15.618
